# Keep the build context small and deterministic: images need only the server
# and benchmark-client sources, plus the license files at the root (LICENSE,
# NOTICE, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md), which the runtime image carries — so they
# must never be added here; everything else is excluded. Local build
# directories must never leak in: `make` would treat a copied binary as up to
# date and the image would ship something its Dockerfile did not build.
.git
.claude
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
server/build
benchmarks/kvbench/build
benchmarks/results
client
docs
*.kvs
